# Source media, kept out of the repo.
# The site serves the derived files in assets/ — the crest cut from
# Radhika.png, the section stills cut from the videos, the score copied to
# assets/music/. The originals stay on disk so those can be regenerated, but
# they are ~39 MB the published site never loads. Anchored to the root with
# a leading slash so nothing under assets/ is caught.
/*.mp4
/*.mp3
/*.jpeg
/*.jpg
/Radhika.png
# Reference material and source artwork dropped in the root. background.png
# is the 5 MB landscape floral the hero frame was re-composed from;
# scratch.png and test1.jpeg are screenshots of the designs being matched.
# Named one by one rather than /*.png, which would swallow the favicons.
/background.png
/scratch.png

# Working document for the client. Carries the families' mobile numbers and
# is not part of the site — keep it out of a public repo.
wedding-details.txt

# Playwright MCP scratch output
.playwright-mcp/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

*.log
